{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1011_p", "source_sha256": "14bb1e2f11a8cd704900f8459a80e1e5ea80212438ec83eecef849d4532c2dda", "ja": "歌織さん、お疲れさまです。\n環と亜利沙も、お疲れさま。", "zh": "歌织小姐，辛苦你了。\n环和亚利沙也辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "421fdf87c7f5970728b5d3bbd51279bca8753cc5886ec31ffa6288e2f7802190", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん？　\nもう、声をかけてくださればよかったのに……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生？\n真是的，既然来了，可以告诉我们一声啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f4ab6c0204ef62bc05a4f89632f9e9ae55f67e40f8f043c04659961b82655b85", "ja": "かけようと思ったんですけど、\n環も亜利沙も真剣だったので。", "zh": "我本来是想这么做，\n但看到环和亚利沙都很认真练习，就作罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "8d3841ff702655fc60659c476016173229024b94d6c811120032a65f051a8197", "ja": "おやぶんおやぶん！\nたまきの歌、どうだった？　上手になった？", "zh": "老大、老大！\n环唱得怎么样？有进步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5bb80cf9a7c9299f07eda83817789c9b6b9c6a4f4b30968b9b8e984f55c383a2", "ja": "最初の頃と比べると、すごく上手になってるぞ。\nもちろん亜利沙もだ。", "zh": "和一开始比起来，进步很多喔。\n当然亚利沙也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "170b552370d9e3afc3f9f2eecff3d4ae82bcf78fbf1bb94e565ef10e68330a0c", "ja": "ムフフ……これも特訓の成果ですね！　これまで、\n子ども達に歌やピアノを教えていた歌織さん……。", "zh": "唔呼呼……这也是特训的成果！\n歌织姊以前担任过小朋友歌唱和钢琴的老师……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "311f4154be04e4b7c78eede9fe66f8c242f68903ba9407280d61e81703e4f406", "ja": "その歌織さんから、毎日レッスンの後、\nさらに特別レッスンを受けていたんですから！", "zh": "所以我们每天练习后，\n都会接受歌织姊这位老师的特别训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "77e05949019e983c5f04ede12ea65e3cd2dd82460d47c28d62ba91a72660c58d", "ja": "アイドルちゃんに歌を教えてもらえる幸せ……\nこれでありさ、上手にならないわけありませんっ！", "zh": "能和偶像宝贝学唱歌是如此幸福……\n亚利沙怎么可能不进步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "e33096c261379ff743d7967606f887f9391bac99d4109e23de39cd73eae724c2", "ja": "たまき、かおりの歌の練習、だーい好きだぞ！\nいつもいっぱいほめてくれるし、やさしいし……。", "zh": "环最～喜欢歌织的歌唱练习了！\n歌织不只会一直夸奖环，又很温柔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "9d1b080dc1a1d60ded5c1dfdbb28672cdce7bc8277be6bfe52db71fda99e84cb", "ja": "くふふ、これからも、ず～っと教えてほしい！", "zh": "呵呵，希望环以后可以一～直让歌织教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "8e7e3df2449f81f07a216f236d39d7592a13001365f25b6fbf446c7ec1fb4cf1", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとう、ふたりとも。\nそんな風に言ってもらえると、私もうれしいな。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你们两个的夸奖。\n能听到你们这么说，我也很开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "fcf0b4a5c68e2955a3669d592e33e65ae205fd5f0f708e90c2069354216ae107", "ja": "ところで亜利沙ちゃん、出掛けるって言ってなかった？\n環ちゃんも、そろそろお家に帰る時間じゃ……。", "zh": "话说回来，亚利沙不是说有事要出去吗？\n小环也是，差不多是该回家的时间了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "e5a925ab5cdcdff58b6b05b3c73260b7f4431598ae91a61f1a15ef454176e2cd", "ja": "はっ……も、もうこんな時間ですかーっ！？\nありがとうございます歌織さん、ありさ失礼しますっ！", "zh": "啊……已、已经这么晚了吗──！？\n谢谢你，歌织姊，亚利沙要先失陪了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "dc067d0765d596d53851be979b9847225843cfac73dfdd14cd02167d9b423ab6", "ja": "今日はこれから、アイドルちゃんの握手会なんです！\nそれじゃ、いってきまーす！", "zh": "今天的偶像宝贝握手会等会就要开始了！\n亚利沙出发啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "58a39c3c74a56ec9ea4bea37d132f0a742b276807476561a3c6a95497b819f8a", "ja": "おやぶん、かおり、たまきも行くね！　ばいば～い！", "zh": "老大、歌织，环也要回去啰！拜拜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1026_p", "source_sha256": "f107d5ae84fc82b626a76db412872ad3d397a484235cdfaaba6c44367dfc800b", "ja": "歌織さん、ありがとうございます。\nセンター公演も近いのに、ふたりに歌を教えてくれて。", "zh": "歌织小姐，谢谢你。\nCenter公演明明近在眼前，还麻烦你教她们唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "2f0ecbf2d8e515d89b6dc5c570a10771d3c1b312bb7188d371aaedd5c78e49a8", "ja": "お気になさらないでください。私も亜利沙ちゃんと\n環ちゃんと一緒にいる方が、落ち着きますから。", "zh": "请不用放在心上。我和亚利沙还有小环在一起时，\n心里反而比较平静。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "c41b039a75a82d1a587d664b4b7288bc8035d7297b2772f66a456f9e366889a4", "ja": "ふたりとも、とってもいい子ですね。\n亜利沙ちゃんは明るくて、優しくて……。", "zh": "她们两个都是好孩子呢。\n亚利沙开朗又温柔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "d588944bd5d8d39f3aa529c8c4dac260406629143de5f91a7a5ba19dc5e096d1", "ja": "環ちゃんはいつも元気で、純粋で……\nとにかく、可愛らしくて……！", "zh": "小环则一向天真又有活力……\n总之，都很惹人疼爱……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1030_p", "source_sha256": "67dae1e83cac28822c00d45da1f4215c5be912a259308881b519adf33d62e095", "ja": "歌織さん？", "zh": "歌织小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "f8d10d76442314bb33477bf0dd1143cdefec9c4e117622579c60049d740d626b", "ja": "{$P$}くん、いる～？　営業の\nお仕事のことで、相談したいことがあるんだけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}，在吗～？\n关于工作，我有些事想和你讨论……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "2a6d7b15e2878e3e27093a2f5b65ac566ab4c7bb889e60386faf7baccecc4d00", "ja": "あら、歌織ちゃん！　なになに、ふたりで\n何を話してたの？　もしかしてこれから飲みに行くの？", "zh": "哎呀，小歌！怎么了怎么了，你们在聊什么？\n难道说待会要去喝一杯吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c2a2fe9ea34a770db2377b68026558aa5f137c9bffd9a5888a0c6108665dec2f", "ja": "違うよ。歌織さんの\nプチ765プロ音楽教室のことについて話してたんだ。", "zh": "不是啦，\n我们在聊歌织小姐的765艺能小小音乐教室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1034_046rio", "source_sha256": "192e0cc1d1b48af0a522fd75eb14d4ff15053927502188859a43c2c21bca6e8f", "ja": "プチ765プロ音楽教室？　何それ？\nいいわ、場所を変えましょう。", "zh": "765艺能小小音乐教室？那是什么？\n我也要听，我们换个地方聊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "fa65162043f990e2df2c7fe0dee6b42d84846d9878d0016ef48f1ccc50277e8f", "ja": "{$P$}くん、もう仕事上がりでしょ？\n詳しく話、聞かせて！", "zh": "{$P$}，你工作做完了吧？\n跟我说说详细经过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1036_p", "source_sha256": "fac036844fa9b1e5516335f4117b7f92d1593bb95c2e50949f99de2f8c790ffa", "ja": "……営業の仕事の話をしに来たんじゃないのか？", "zh": "……你不是来谈工作的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "7b2cff34d5990db1e8f62da780a9f8ff090ac0d5e34def6cd637f17fb04f51cb", "ja": "そんなの場所を変えたって話せるわよ♪\nそれにね、駅前にいいお店、見つけちゃったの！", "zh": "那种事情不管在哪里都可以聊吧♪\n而且啊，我在车站前发现一间很棒的店喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1038_052kao", "source_sha256": "db02808bb8ea96a6aeb13ef0b2c96b2e1806d743a67a3a697af729c0edb788ec", "ja": "あの……公演の本番も近いので、お酒は……。\nちょっと控えておこうかなって。", "zh": "那个……很快就要正式公演了……我想……\n尽量不要喝酒比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1039_046rio", "source_sha256": "64745c5ddd521b6a9ba9a61e8ccb8fe4c7c863e10c01a52c0e3c3f76399eadeb", "ja": "あ、そっか。じゃあアルコールは無しね。\nごはんだけならいいでしょ、ね？", "zh": "啊，这样啊。那就不要喝酒，\n只要吃饭就好了。好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "ed16500611221c9ce9c6861e185fe4fdac5438beaa999eeeb0683f8e6898b1a3", "ja": "……ごめんなさい、莉緒ちゃん。私、この後は\nダンスの振り付けを確認しようと思ってたの。", "zh": "……抱歉，莉绪。\n接下来我想再确认一下舞步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "d9a34f52cd1694e2e8b3299f5b2060e2330dddd4d8cb9cd2c03f14e1b24cf691", "ja": "え～っ、そんなぁ～……。\nもう、マジメなんだからっ。", "zh": "咦～怎么这样……\n真是的，你就是太认真了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1042_p", "source_sha256": "dd8da5b8c1c612efd26e5f2e38cdee3290a52ee691a125e68a7d8de596e4940b", "ja": "振り付けの確認って、今からですか？", "zh": "现在就要开始确认舞步了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1043_052kao", "source_sha256": "f546ff1b22630ad7b60f66ac90394b2ac78ba18f46d35fb5c2e5244563d2ee6c", "ja": "はい。それに、立ち位置やMCの流れも、きちんと\n身についてるか不安で……。ダメですね、私。", "zh": "是的，其他像走位及主持流程，\n我也很担心有没有记熟……我真的很没用呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1044_052kao", "source_sha256": "47bbd3d298bd58b384f6f3a47a2eedb597845df7c80e6b9bc77486c34b1d909b", "ja": "せっかく、{$P$}さんが\n私を信頼して、任せてくださったのに……。", "zh": "难得{$P$}先生这么信任我，\n把这个位置交给我担任……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1045_p", "source_sha256": "a22a9e75d1b45a7fbb461903c5ab538b18e651ee13a5d971d785c7688c13b8c0", "ja": "歌織さん……。", "zh": "歌织小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "bb527ce5738d2fa664a006aa9f3058ecdc41d86699b276e8ee485f092c6fd548", "ja": "歌織ちゃんなら平気だと思うけどなぁ～。\nステージに立つのだって、慣れてるんでしょ？", "zh": "我倒觉得小歌一定应付得来～\n你不是很习惯上台表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1047_052kao", "source_sha256": "eb3197d7590acc437dc54805dc76731e886d862c661ac7efa029338374500a99", "ja": "うん、歌うだけなら……。でもね、気づいたの。\n私は今回、アイドルとして立つんだって……。", "zh": "嗯，如果只是唱歌的话……但是，我发现了一件事。\n这次我是以偶像的身分站在舞台上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1048_052kao", "source_sha256": "2e2d3fd46739a3071a23f2474903aa84f27fd69d98ed246845a9010bcded260c", "ja": "お客さん達の心に届けなくちゃいけないのは、\nきっと歌だけじゃなくて……アイドルとしての輝き。", "zh": "真正必须传达到客人心里的不只是歌声，\n肯定……还有身为偶像的光芒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1049_052kao", "source_sha256": "3c7f59fdf38a94396fa54da854e06f4a70ecb44474f87961c4941113b7acd8fb", "ja": "莉緒ちゃん、それに亜利沙ちゃん、環ちゃん達の輝きを\n届けるためにも、私……、まだまだ足りないと思うの。", "zh": "为了让客人感受到莉绪，还有亚利沙跟小环你们的光芒，\n我……还有很多需要加强的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1050_052kao", "source_sha256": "fda8759bd82528fb32ef2a39e890e99a5a02fd28e83621b5df1685f6119902d6", "ja": "コンクールで歌うのとは、全然違っていて。\n何度練習しても、ちっとも大丈夫って思えない……。", "zh": "这和在竞赛中唱歌完全不同。\n不管练习多少次，我还是没办法放心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1051_046rio", "source_sha256": "6396f88713b5f4d48b1834a6e35e348d32fdaa58220d5d86ffff534b65d5b7b3", "ja": "歌織ちゃん……。\nその気持ち、わかるわ！", "zh": "小歌……\n我懂你的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1052_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1053_046rio", "source_sha256": "7b58a2c698f24fe70646521eccaf612c1602378d5b4686b56a818d27fc1c3899", "ja": "私も毎日、ファンのみんなにアピールするには、\nどういうファッションがいいか考えて、心配になるの。", "zh": "我每天也都在思考，什么样的穿着打扮\n最能吸引粉丝？而且总是越想越不放心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1054_046rio", "source_sha256": "8965e16d787eae25bfb044f0f07329c5be88bbe852043e42265b048e85a9c0a3", "ja": "この服だと派手すぎかな？　この服だと地味かな？\nそもそもセクシーに思ってもらえるかしら？って。", "zh": "像是这件衣服会不会太浮夸啦，那件会不会太朴素啦，\n甚至会烦恼粉丝们真的觉得我性感吗？之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1055_p", "source_sha256": "ae171d3d68ea2e7a6de0f1413d387617e38bb644a2409eb29dc871a4b49c7bc8", "ja": "な、なるほど。\nそういう時、莉緒はどうするんだ？", "zh": "原、原来如此。\n像这种时候，莉绪会怎么做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1056_046rio", "source_sha256": "f8d499b50711ae3ab01c38cd5711242682be2884ac443ec5854df1b3bc42b43b", "ja": "別に何もしないわよ。ただ、覚悟を決めるの。\nもうこれでいってやる！……ってね。", "zh": "不会特别做什么啊，就只是做好\n「今天就决定穿这件！」的觉悟而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1057_046rio", "source_sha256": "8d1bf871d13ca9ebc65a7ecee7a3d5f1aedc5c0f2854f771230ff2c0eda044bf", "ja": "ほら、女は度胸って、よく言うでしょ？\n恋愛も人生も、みんな同じよ。", "zh": "人家不是常说，女人要有胆量吗？\n不管恋爱还是人生，都是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1058_052kao", "source_sha256": "46a8f37e6d7a8c59397d0512115f3ae28fe808a2d9d729fc01d369a596547c7d", "ja": "女は度胸……。", "zh": "女人要有胆量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1059_046rio", "source_sha256": "4e61b3e84c73816ab55c7abbfcbb4f5054415d86c54a2a8f84e30b8da8f07efc", "ja": "そう、女は度胸、アイドルも度胸！　私たちって、\n勢いでアイドルになっちゃったようなものじゃない？", "zh": "没错，女人要有胆量，偶像也要有胆量！\n我们不就是凭着一股冲劲，才成为偶像的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1060_046rio", "source_sha256": "29c9338ba6f10ea670d07a6e810d67e3f2fda904aa634a115bb8a7aa8a8651db", "ja": "ほら、そこの{$P$}くんに、\n口八丁手八丁で口説かれて。", "zh": "还记得吧，就是被那边那位能言善道，\n手腕又精明的{$P$}说服的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1061_p", "source_sha256": "9ab418f371106940a830f9f03e17007edef4956a13d06b9d4a43b0972d0eda4f", "ja": "いやスカウトだから。\n普通にスカウトしただけだからな？", "zh": "不是，那是在物色人才。\n我只是很普通地发掘你们来当偶像而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1062_046rio", "source_sha256": "5d887d35dd8f51c92cf0e71c362bb23aa66a7dd776e4c97a54e6cbea9e2af5af", "ja": "ふふっ、歌織ちゃんの前だからって焦らないの！\nもう、カワイイんだから♪", "zh": "呵呵，就算是在小歌面前，也用不着那么慌张吧！\n真是的，你就是这么可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1063_p", "source_sha256": "db8e7c0e026169d3bb36a4ce922c4c5a0149aa5f9d89fe581a59be97fdc91535", "ja": "そ、そういうわけじゃ……。", "zh": "不、不是这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1064_046rio", "source_sha256": "c50978d260616a7464b8b5ab6f5aef78d9ea47e413bbab7ee43a65536ebfbdc2", "ja": "ま、{$P$}くんはおいといて……。\nなっちゃったものはしょうがないわよね。", "zh": "总之，先不管{$P$}……\n既然已经当上偶像，那就只能顺其自然了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1065_046rio", "source_sha256": "62f33ba220e1b8347b04462c7f7d10adcfa2f469bf1ed8efbf2aea16c83dd86e", "ja": "あとは、とりあえず飛び込んでみないと。\n何があるかわからないから。ねっ！", "zh": "还有，要是不亲自挑战看看，\n根本不知道能得到什么成果，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_005_1066_052kao", "source_sha256": "4fb60166886a9e6ce1c970af068bff58720a5d21f34942e3df8142a14d292478", "ja": "ふっ……ふふっ！　莉緒ちゃん、すごいわ。\nそんな風に勇気を出せるなんて……！", "zh": "呵……呵呵！莉绪好厉害。\n原来你都是这样鼓起勇气的啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
